# Push destination

When the user asks you to build or change this project, commit the work and push it to:

https://github.com/mohdhammad18/DC_PROJECT_MARR.git

- Remote name: `origin`
- Default branch: `main`
- Do this after the requested work is in place, without waiting for a separate push request.
- Do not force-push. Do not change git config. Do not commit secrets (`.env`, credentials, keys).
- If the push needs authentication and fails, say so and stop. Do not invent credentials or switch remotes.
